            <title>[IGNITE-4231] Hangs on compute result serialization error</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4231</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Compute task may hang if was thrown exception on result serialization. This should be properly handled and responded to client.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
