                            <comment id="15673055" author="dkarachentsev" created="Thu, 17 Nov 2016 07:38:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/1238&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR #1238&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15683947" author="sboikov" created="Mon, 21 Nov 2016 16:02:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Fix looks good, but I think we need improve it a little:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;now marshaller also can throw exception when &apos;ex&apos; or &apos;attrs&apos; are marshalled (&apos;loc ? null : U.marshal(marsh, ex)&apos;;  &apos;loc ? null : U.marshal(marsh, attrs)&apos;), need handle these errors as well&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;for response marshall error please also include in error message response class name (&apos;Failed to serialize job response [resCls=&apos; ...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15686822" author="dkarachentsev" created="Tue, 22 Nov 2016 13:59:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Thanks, Semen. Please, check again.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15689289" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 23 Nov 2016 08:07:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Looks good to merge.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
